  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "The air can't keep up with the ground.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 2.65,
   "sha256": "ea977d4a95593f36b40daed6666896f28a5431144218922e22304d54a23df96e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "wind-1",
   "text": "But the air has a problem.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 1.05,
   "sha256": "5b2ab7be6d4bf38d9cdfe6581625b1cc10af8cffbe96b21587c4ab1859694a0f"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "wind-2",
   "text": "The ground speeds up at once; the atmosphere is pulled along only by friction, and that takes time.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 4.07,
   "sha256": "1ab46ed42659ea91923dac0261733817d720d2a75c7aa987d81500c0d969f806"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "wind-3",
   "text": "For the first hours, the air is left behind.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 1.94,
   "sha256": "9f13cf2dca6b0f3707532652cd2b03a5c5503791b249877abc6e925d92f8df0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "wind-4",
   "text": "At a twelve hour day, the ground is moving through the air at about four hundred and sixty meters a second, faster than the speed of sound.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 5.95,
   "sha256": "76edc2e50de209ed9021173f3f909a33542b286d2698d98178be730e9f202ecd"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "wind-5",
   "text": "Winds like that would strip the surface, and they would only be the beginning.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 2.25,
   "sha256": "e5a320b68dab5a312b60c04ce564913260f1354f13512e63c5d347d86b2fcbbf"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Hang on. If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow. Okay, back to the math.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 4.03,
   "sha256": "5ed901cc5a87bb8e232cd6275c084613b3a298c16aa12569c84f30098ae01bba"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And then the oceans start to move.",
